WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.450
Let’s take attendance with your class’s QR code.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.870
Open Attendance, check your class, and choose the meeting date.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:13.290
Select Show attendance QR, and display the code for your class.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:17.519
Children scan the code, enter their full name, and tap I’m here.

00:00:17.839 --> 00:00:22.843
Return to the roster. A request is waiting, but attendance is not marked yet.

00:00:23.163 --> 00:00:27.441
Confirm the children who are here. Dismiss requests you cannot verify.

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:33.631
No phone? Mark attendance manually. Check-ins only work during the class’s posted window.

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:40.709
Review every request and attendance mark. Finish closes check-in and marks anyone still unmarked absent.
